# The database, its SQLite sidecar files, and any hand-taken backups — see
# .gitignore's comment: the backups alone are multi-gigabyte. None of this
# belongs in a build context; each container gets its own, empty, via its own
# mounted volume.
db.sqlite*
dom.log
dom.log.1

# Cargo's own build output — multi-gigabyte and entirely stale outside the
# container anyway (the builder stage compiles fresh).
/target

.git
.serena
**/*.rs.bk
**/mutants.out*/
